===Results===
Given the lack of a high-profile candidate on the Democratic side, throughout the campaign many considered Kempthorne's election a foregone conclusion. Indeed, Huntley's performance was well below that of the 1994 Democratic nominee [[Larry EchoHawk]]. In addition, Peter Rickards, a podiatrist and anti-nuclear waste advocate from [[Twin Falls, Idaho|Twin Falls]], won over some progressive votes that may have otherwise gone to the Democratic candidate.

